5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since it's the first day, we have no information yet. Let's keep our observations sharp and see how everyone behaves. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in your stories.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay, a mystery game! I'm so excited! I'll be looking for clues too, but I might get a little distracted. Let's all try to be super honest... or not! Teehee!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. Since we have no data, we should focus on observing speech patterns and reactions. I will be watching carefully to see who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and patient approach will serve us best. I will listen quietly and reflect on what is said.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so pumped for this! It's like a real detective movie! I'll do my best to help everyone find the werewolf, even if I get a bit confused. Let's have fun with this!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we are all in agreement about the approach. Since there are no clues yet, I'll focus on the dynamics between us. Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to propose for the coming days?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, a strategy? Maybe we should play a game of ""I Spy"" with our feelings! If someone looks too nervous or too happy, that's a clue, right? I'm going to keep a secret notebook of everyone's faces!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Emotional reactions can be misleading, Sakura. I believe it is more effective to analyze the logic of our arguments and the timing of our accusations. Let us see who attempts to lead the vote prematurely.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Logic is indeed a sturdy foundation, Toshio. However, let us not forget that silence can be as telling as speech. I shall simply observe the flow of our conversation.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"A secret notebook? That sounds awesome, Sakura! I'll help you look for clues! I think we should just be honest and trust each other. Let's see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Trusting everyone blindly is a dangerous game, Kenji. While I appreciate the optimism, we must remember that there is a werewolf among us. Let's remain vigilant and prioritize logical evidence over simple trust.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, Mizuki is being so serious! But that's what makes it a challenge, right? I'll be a super-duper detective and find the werewolf with my special powers! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is too early to name a suspect. Any accusation now would be based on mere intuition, which is unreliable. I prefer to wait for the first night's results to establish a factual baseline.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. Rushing to judgment without evidence often leads to unnecessary mistakes. Let us maintain our composure and wait for the morning to bring us more clarity.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"You're right, Mizuki! I forgot we're actually hunting a werewolf. I'll try to be more careful! I don't have any suspects yet, but I'm ready to help whenever we find a real clue!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's conclude today's discussion here. We've established our general approach, and now we must wait for the Seer's first insight. Stay alert, everyone. I'll see you all tomorrow morning.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
