24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I will spend the night analyzing the possibilities. Let us hope the first divination provides the clarity we need to move forward logically. Goodnight.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
