28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I hope the Seer finds something cool tonight. I'm gonna get some sleep so I can be a great detective tomorrow! See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
