69,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Sakura was executed, and Toshio was attacked. This is a critical blow. The werewolf targeted Toshio, likely because his logical approach was a threat. We must be even more vigilant now. Does anyone have information?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a tragedy to lose two of our companions so quickly. Toshio's loss is particularly felt, as his clarity was a guiding light. I wonder if the Seer has found any truth in the shadows.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, this is getting scary! I can't believe Toshio is gone too! He was so smart, he probably would've found the wolf in no time. Does the Seer know anything? Please tell us!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"The fact that Toshio was targeted suggests the werewolf feared his analytical mind. With only three of us left, the Seer must speak now. If you are the Seer, please reveal your findings before it's too late.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am not the Seer, though I share Mizuki's urgency. With so few of us remaining, the truth must surface. If the Seer is still among us, your guidance is now our only hope.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not the Seer either! This is getting really intense. If the Seer is still here, you've gotta tell us something! Otherwise, the werewolf is just gonna win! I'm getting really nervous now!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Both Jonathan and Kenji claim they aren't the Seer. If that's true, then I must be the only one left, but I am a Villager. This means either one of them is lying, or the Seer is already dead.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If we are all telling the truth, then the Seer has indeed fallen. This leaves us in a precarious position. We must look closely at the remaining patterns to identify the wolf.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, what?! If Mizuki is a Villager and I'm not the Seer, and Jonathan says he isn't either... then the Seer is really gone? That's terrible! Now it's just us three! Who do we trust?!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If the Seer is dead, we must rely on logic. Jonathan, you've been very composed, but that can be a mask. Kenji, your panic is natural, but could be an act. I'll vote based on who seems most calculated.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Calculated or not, my goal remains the same: the survival of the village. If we are to find the wolf among us, we must look at who benefits most from this silence. I trust my intuition.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to be the one who's calculated! I'm just really scared! Mizuki, Jonathan, please trust me! I'm just a regular kid who wants us to win! Who do you guys think it is?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
